    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/67da4ea7adb75e03394c6087dd80f62d.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/67da4ea7adb75e03394c6087dd80f62d.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Usually when you wake up in your live/work cubicle to the soothing sounds of guided meditations, everything is great. </h2>Your console is ready, your food pellets taste fresh, your bean bag chair is plump. You\u2019re ready for the first day of your unpaid internship. But today something feels wrong. The guided meditation doesn\u2019t feel the same when you\u2019re receiving urgent messages warning you not to listen to it. The first day of your unpaid internship feels less exciting when you\u2019re reminded that it\u2019s been the first day, every day, for years now. Are your food pellets even that fresh? Is your bean chair even that plump? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d79fd33a45c47b6a95eb93f589d6fe73.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d79fd33a45c47b6a95eb93f589d6fe73.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It might be time to wake up from this capitalist fever dream disguised as a corporate wellness meditation.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/013e0e70bdbaa377011dcbc0c364ed41.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/013e0e70bdbaa377011dcbc0c364ed41.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Dive deep into the lore of the company you work for: Tough Guy Mountain, the company that turned the entire world into a marketing campaign to fulfill its sinister goals. Discover how the company started, how it ended(?), and why you\u2019re still stuck here!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d60a5139c5395ec4c865900b4adbd623.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d60a5139c5395ec4c865900b4adbd623.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/67da4ea7adb75e03394c6087dd80f62d.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/67da4ea7adb75e03394c6087dd80f62d.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Usually when you wake up in your live/work cubicle to the soothing sounds of guided meditations, everything is great. </h2>Your console is ready, your food pellets taste fresh, your bean bag chair is plump. You\u2019re ready for the first day of your unpaid internship. But today something feels wrong. The guided meditation doesn\u2019t feel the same when you\u2019re receiving urgent messages warning you not to listen to it. The first day of your unpaid internship feels less exciting when you\u2019re reminded that it\u2019s been the first day, every day, for years now. Are your food pellets even that fresh? Is your bean chair even that plump? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d79fd33a45c47b6a95eb93f589d6fe73.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d79fd33a45c47b6a95eb93f589d6fe73.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It might be time to wake up from this capitalist fever dream disguised as a corporate wellness meditation.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/013e0e70bdbaa377011dcbc0c364ed41.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/013e0e70bdbaa377011dcbc0c364ed41.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Dive deep into the lore of the company you work for: Tough Guy Mountain, the company that turned the entire world into a marketing campaign to fulfill its sinister goals. Discover how the company started, how it ended(?), and why you\u2019re still stuck here!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d60a5139c5395ec4c865900b4adbd623.poster.avif?t=1719925965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840380/extras/d60a5139c5395ec4c865900b4adbd623.webm?t=1719925965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
